<title>POLAND: SOKOLOW TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 3.3, 3.65.</title>
<headline>SOKOLOW TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 3.3, 3.65.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two kerb transactions in blocks of 649,000 and 380,850 shares in Sokolow at 3.3 and 3.65 zlotys respectively were struck on the Warsaw bourse on Monday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>At the regular session, Sokolow traded at 3.8 zlotys in a 56,698-share volume.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
